A.u11. {"problem": "The request says the owner sees the deadline when the decision is asked. The deadline is only an unconstrained free-text string stored on the request. Nothing declares or checks that it is a date, and nothing shows it to the owner. No scenario or fixture covers a request with a deadline (DR1 has none), and nothing relates the deadline to `decide`. Because no rule or scenario covers it, the stated behaviour is unverified.", "where": "authoring.domain.yaml, DecisionRequest.deadline, scenarios and world fixtures", "kind": "other", "from": "llm"}
